comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-25T10:11:07.630Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete live all-status 2801-item inventory and request-specific searches found no owner for GH-1305. Reuse pm-f05lsg and historical pm-htbetn. Report: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1305"
  "2026-09-25T10:15:06.551Z","harness:codex","new SDK refusal assertions failed before implementation because missing_fields and policy identity were discarded. Implemented typed policy evidence, explicit policy surfaces, declared metadata flag recovery and human missing-field diagnostics; focused SDK and transport regression verification running."
  "2026-09-25T10:31:12.707Z","harness:codex","Architecture: retain domain evidence in the shared typed PmCliErrorContext, render only in the CLI adapter, and preserve MCP propagation from the same SDK path. No transport-specific policy evaluation or new optional package API is introduced. Added real CLI JSON/human and MCP parity assertions plus custom metadata recovery without invented flags."
  "2026-09-25T10:46:12.825Z","harness:codex","Final review: creation/import refusals now direct callers to supply evidence in the original request, because no item exists to update. Existing-item recovery still uses canonical flags or declared custom SDK contracts. Added assertions in the existing lifecycle and custom-field regression tests."
  "2026-09-25T11:05:02.054Z","harness:codex","Final regressions pass after correcting the custom-field test to exercise a lifecycle transition. Required-field policy deliberately permits unrelated title-only edits, so the test now refuses closure. The policy store has exact 100/100/100/100 focused coverage. One linked rerun timed out waiting for the exclusive build lease held by full coverage; tests are being rerun sequentially without changing timeouts."
  "2026-09-25T11:07:12.204Z","harness:codex","Final local evidence: all four linked test commands passed sequentially with zero assertion failures or timeouts. Changed-source typecheck and ESLint pass. Hosted exact-head static and full coverage gates remain required before merge; prior full-run failure details were investigated and corrected without relaxing gates."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-25T10:29:51.004Z","harness:codex",A valid parsed option is not the source of a policy refusal. Preserve policy identity and missing metadata at the SDK error boundary so every transport can explain the real recovery.
